# Task 65: keeps docker/Dockerfile.integration-test's `COPY . /opt/snapcast-manager`
# build context small and, more importantly, genuinely FRESH -- this must
# never ship a stale local build artifact or a machine-specific
# node_modules/ into the image; install.sh's own `npm install`/`npm run
# build` steps (run for real inside the container) are what should produce
# these, exercising the real build path this task is meant to verify.
#
# Deliberately at the REPO ROOT, not next to docker/Dockerfile.integration-test:
# `.dockerignore` is resolved relative to the build CONTEXT directory, not
# the Dockerfile's own location, regardless of which `-f <path>` a build
# uses -- see the build step in .github/workflows/container-integration.yml,
# which runs `docker build -f docker/Dockerfile.integration-test .` with
# repo root (`.`) as the context.
.git
.github
node_modules
server/node_modules
server/dist
client/node_modules
client/dist
**/*.log
